      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="NLJ0001r" />
                  <hi rend="pre-print">Dr. Arthur Schnitzler</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <hi rend="pre-print">
                     <rs ref="#pmb168940" type="place">Wien, XVIII. Spoettelgasse 7</rs>.</hi>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
            <address>
               <addrLine>Herrn <hi rend="latintype">Albert Ehrenstein,</hi>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs ref="#pmb300" type="place">
                     <hi rend="latintype">Ottakringerstr. 114</hi>
                  </rs>.</addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="NLJ0001v" />
                  <date>19/12 906</date>.</dateline>
               <salute>lieber Herr Ehrenstein,</salute>
            </opener>
            <p>Wenn Sie ſich <date>Freitag</date> Na halb vier die <rs ref="#pmb33398" type="work">Helena</rs> von mir abholen wollen, wird es mir angenehm ſein, Sie bei dieſer
               Gelegenheit zu ſprechen.</p>
            <closer>beſtens grüß<unclear>end</unclear>
               <lb />Ihr <unclear>e</unclear>rgeb <signed>A. S.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
